# w3id.org permanent identifier: https://w3id.org/studium
# Studium vocabulary, Holobiomics Lab (CNRS / Universite Cote d'Azur).
#   https://w3id.org/studium#…   Studium vocabulary terms (the scene types of a lesson bundle)
# The document is served by holobiomicslab.cnrs.fr, which answers by content
# negotiation (303 to HTML, Turtle, JSON-LD or RDF/XML); the Accept header is
# passed on unchanged by the redirect below.
# Maintainer: https://github.com/HolobiomicsLab/Studium

Options -MultiViews
RewriteEngine On

RewriteRule ^$ https://holobiomicslab.cnrs.fr/ns/studium [R=303,L]
